third_party/rawtherapee contains the pinned official RawTherapee 5.12 source and
resources, with separately documented SoftLoaf preview/build changes. Its GPL
and component/resource licenses remain in that tree and take precedence over
the root default for those files. LibRaw retains its upstream LGPL/CDDL options
and notices. No private camera calibration or code from another product is
included in this source integration. See third_party/rawtherapee/SoftLoaf.md.

The original scanline PNG interface links to libpng (PNG Reference Library
License) and zlib through the configured build dependency. No other product
implementation was copied for the streaming image or cache settings modules.

The optional scan lens adapter uses the separately installed public Lensfun
library and database, currently tested with 0.3.4. Lensfun library, tools and data
retain their upstream LGPL-3.0, GPL-3.0 and CC-BY-SA-3.0 terms respectively; no Lensfun
database or binary is bundled here. Frozen selections record source XML hashes
and Lensfun attribution. Other products' private profiles are not imported.

assets/science/cie contains unmodified original International Commission on
Illumination datasets and metadata, obtained directly from CIE. These data use
CC-BY-SA-4.0, separately from the code licence. Dataset titles, source URLs,
DOIs, hashes, attribution and licence links are in that directory. No CIE
endorsement is implied. These source acquisitions do not clear other materials.
